Sober "1" -- "*" Car : operates
Sober "1" -- "*" CarOwner : tracks
Car "1" -- "*" Accident : involved in
Car "1" -- "0..1" CarOwner : owned by
Car "1" -- "*" RideHailingTrip
Car "1" -- "*" RideSharingTrip
RideHailingTrip "1" -- "1" Customer : lead customer
RideHailingTrip "1" -- "1..6" Customer : passenger
